# The full-screen terminal at 320x480 (profile p320; study portrait-320, PR-A): the CLI takes the whole screen, 14 px
# font (40 columns), and asks for the on-screen keyboard (no physical keyboard). Letters are tapped on the keyboard and
# reach the PTY; a physical keyboard then removes the keyboard and the grid takes the full height. Golden at 320x480.
title p320 terminal
sizes 320x480
profile p320
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_OSK auto
keyboards 0
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch CLI
ptyout "user@zero8:~$ "
wait 300
expect_osk shown
shot p320_terminal_osk
tapkey h
tapkey i
ptylog p320_terminal_keys
keyboards 1
wait 800
expect_osk hidden
shot p320_terminal_full
